WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.730
Welcome to Module 5.

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:07.440
Today we go turn our numbers into pictures — charts and dashboard.

00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:10.328
Bar chart na for comparing.

00:00:10.328 --> 00:00:13.408
Di longer di bar, di bigger di number.

00:00:13.408 --> 00:00:17.380
E go show you quick-quick which product dey lead.

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:24.574
Line chart show you how things dey change from day to day, or month to month.

00:00:24.574 --> 00:00:27.020
If di line dey climb, e good.

00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:29.888
If e dey fall, check wetin happen.

00:00:30.588 --> 00:00:37.963
Dashboard na one page wey carry di important things: total, best product, and your two charts.

00:00:37.963 --> 00:00:40.788
Look am every morning with your tea.

00:00:41.488 --> 00:00:44.534
No need to read long list of numbers.

00:00:44.534 --> 00:00:48.568
One look, and you don know how your business dey.

00:00:49.268 --> 00:00:54.507
Put your data inside Data Wey Talk and see your own charts.

00:00:54.507 --> 00:00:56.372
See you for Module 6!
